### Test Basic Endpoints
### Probar endpoints básicos para verificar si el backend está funcionando

### 1. Test endpoint básico de salud
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Test endpoint de categorías (más simple)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categorias
Accept: application/json

### 3. Test endpoint de tickets
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Accept: application/json

### 4. Test endpoint SLA con headers específicos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sla
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

